        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CARPRO19ENTR, Keyed Provence Clear Crystal Knob with Carre Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Provence Crystal Knob with Carre Plate Entryset is stunning with its historic sensibilities mixed with transitional detailing. This single cylinder front door lock is perfect for new and old homes alike. It masterfully straddles the line between traditional and contemporary for maximum transitional appeal. The Keyed Provence Clear Crystal Knob with Carre Plate has an egg shaped knob and a stepped backplate. It is available in many finish options.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/provence-crystal-knob-with-carre-plate-grandeur-carpro19\"><b>Provence Crystal Knob with Carre Tall Plate</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Provence Knob with Carre Tall Plate Keyed Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Provence Crystal Knob with Tall Carre Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Plate Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.1\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CARPRO19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262398\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CARPRO19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
